We are writing to tell you about your Social Security disability benefits.

Your monthly benefit beginning January 2026 is $1,150.00. This amount includes the 2026 cost-of-living adjustment. We will pay your benefit on or about the third Wednesday of each month by direct deposit to your account ending in 0381.

Things to remember: You must tell us if you return to work or if your work activity changes. If you have questions, call 1-800-772-1213 or visit www.ssa.gov.

